                5 5 (flohp-stamp) "Form cells observe the available local model, decide and actuate: live 1000/1000/0/0 selected rest-and-fuse; coverage mint is wired and its pure band answers 255; the completed 4284-iteration authoring adaptation retained unknown nothing 3/3, reworded facts 12/12, permission facts 6/6 and a 40-token authoring return; one unattended cycle cell now invokes observe->decide->execute and a 1807496278-byte fused artifact exists; no trainer, llama-server or Ollama process is currently present; observer/actuator still cross host-exec into mlx_lm"
                (fmcl-execution-category) "replace directive string dispatch with admitted content-addressed calls and bind every local carrier outcome to a structural ACK")
            (flohm-organ "local-training-loop-offline-outcome-ack" 1
                5 5 (flohp-stamp) "v1 retained the invalid /usr/bin/test crossing as failure; correlated framebuffer revise/reobserve 255 selected /bin/test; v2 returned exit 0 with adapter NodeID, six-file runnable manifest NodeID, path, 1824757231 bytes and seal 8f4b387c...; rows 3->4 through atomic file_append_bytes; exact replay refused with append 0 and rows 4->4; local cached path plus offline env only; pure band 65535; live 8191"
                (fmcl-continuation-category) "re-admit under a fresh correlation whenever adapter or any runnable-manifest byte changes")
            (flohm-organ "local-training-carrier-deadline" 0
                5 4 (flohp-stamp) "the structural ACK preserves timeout distinctly, but current train/generate/fuse host-exec calls have no process-group deadline; an offered carrier can still stall before leaving the record the ACK requires"
                (fmcl-attempt-category) "bind the installed local form-run through a Form-rendered process-group watchdog and prove true/false/sleep plus success-shaped-timeout without opening a model")
            (flohm-organ "heldout-local-form-transfer" 0
                5 5 (flohp-stamp) "the body-authored observer retains 1000/1000/0/0 and rest-and-fuse; coverage mint keeps 35 provenance-grounded long-form rows; the completed authoring adaptation retains unknown nothing 3/3, reworded facts 12/12, permission facts 6/6 and an authoring return; the fused six-file runnable manifest is now freshly sealed and resolved path-only/offline, while frozen source-disjoint BML 59cb and canonical 511 transfer harnesses remain unrehearsed after this training"
                (fmcl-attempt-category) "re-run the unchanged frozen harnesses against the sealed fused local path without selecting on them, then compare heldout transfer")
            (flohm-organ "applied-live-diagnostic-control" 1
                4 5 (flohp-stamp) "opaque attempt -> timeout -> raw alternative -> focused heldout re-observation"
                (fmcl-signal-category) "retain stage correlation and re-observe every control action")
            (flohm-organ "adaptive-bml-outer-flow-control" 1
                5 5 (flohp-stamp) "current attempt-ID suffix discovers a varied multi-token motif repeated three times; correlated framebuffer action 4 requests evidence before another prediction pulse; exact timeout hold preserves session/pending/prefix/cursor/attempt IDs, nothing/0/1 and choice/cut/undo/timeout/failure/refinement/release counters; pure band 4095; live driver depth 0; next model re-witness still owed"
                (fmcl-signal-category) "re-witness the next available local stream, then resume, branch, revise, dissolve or abstain from the correlated held checkpoint")
            (flohm-organ "local-adaptive-memory-promotion" 0
                5 4 (flohp-stamp) "one answer-free supervised query memory persisted with content-addressed undo; rotated heldout keep-or-undo not yet observed"
                (fmcl-persistence-category) "persist accepted learning with rollback and held-out witness")
            (flohm-organ "offline-self-directed-hourly-loop" 0
                5 4 (flohp-stamp) "the shared 12-field map schema now reaches correlated control and the selected action; self-direction band 1048575; live tick re-observes and returns typed nothing for the still-unbound selected recipe; bounded autonomous wake remains absent"
                (fmcl-continuation-category) "bind the exact observed actuator to a bounded native wake while retaining every concurrent carrier signal")
            (flohm-organ "repository-object-graph" 1
                5 4 (flohp-stamp) "commit-graph verify + ordinary strict fsck exit 0"
                (fmcl-persistence-category) "re-witness after object-store movement")
            (flohm-organ "offline-recovery-copy" 0
                4 4 (flohp-stamp) "inventory observed no restored independent repository or Qwen copy"
                (fmcl-persistence-category) "restore-test on a separately powered local volume when one is available")
            (flohm-organ "local-proof-latency" 0
                4 5 (flohp-stamp) "one-residence family batch still spent about 368-546s per row; model reopen was not the dominant cost; redundant pure-Form response/corpus SHA observation exceeded 90s and was cut; the minute-long JIT stall was bare-nothing function-value leakage and became subsecond after exact (nothing); retained NodeID executable invocation is now 1ms per 10000 calls versus 33-37ms through the old 1292-byte image path, with recursive native/Form 100-flow parity at 3ms/5ms; a complete traversal-calibrated 256-tag heat window plus 10000-step workload and the form-cli 14-signal JIT gate band each complete below 100ms shell resolution"
                (fmcl-execution-category) "retain stage timing; preserve exact nothing before interpreting duration as compute; lift heat to function/NodeID and observe cross-image call costs, while keeping SHA only at persistence or trust membranes")))

    (defn flohp-run ()
        (do
            (let map (flohm-map (flohp-stamp) (flohp-rows)))
            (let continuity (scr-receipt (scr-state 0 0 0 1
                (if (eq (flohm-gap-count map) 0) 1 0)
                (flohm-ready-count map) 0 (flohm-valid-count map))))
            (list "form-local-offline-health-pulse-v1" map continuity)))

    (flohp-run))
